			"Message": "feat(Wind): Regenerate service and command catalogs\n\nUpdate the generated TypeScript definitions in the Wind UI service layer to reflect the latest upstream VS Code interface state. This process involves refreshing the `CommandCatalog` and `ServiceCatalog` artifacts located in `Source/Effect/Generated`.\n\nKey modifications:\n- Incremented `CommandCatalogVersion` and `ServiceCatalogVersion` from `2026-05-13` to `2026-05-14`.\n- Confirmed `CommandCatalogTotal` at 547 commands.\n- Confirmed `ServiceCatalogTotal` at 490 services.\n\nThis ensures the Wind layer remains synchronized with the current `Dependency/Microsoft/Dependency/Editor` upstream registry.",
